iv>\r\n    <div class='line stable' data-code='83456'>PATIENT #089 - STABLE</div>\r\n    <div class='line stable' data-code='333224'>PATIENT #013 - STABLE</div>\r\n    <div class='line critical'>PATIENT #121 - CRITICAL</div>\r\n    <div class='line error'>PATIENT #003 - ERROR</div><br>&gt; END OF FILE\r\n</div>\"",
